            "review_title": "Review at Starbucks Vista",
            "review_text": "Soko37\nBudapest, Hungary20962 contributions\n1\nCoffee ☕️ at Vista\nJan 2021 • Solo\nBusy place in Vista towers shopping 🛍 mall place. Part of small shopping 🛒 mall, possibility to access directly from outside or inside of mall. You could sit inside or outside depending on weather. Place is relatively full during the day as it’s common meeting point for Vista residence people or visitors. Typical standard Starbucks ambience but still looking fresh. Staff experienced to serve you deserved coffee ☕️ or drink 🥤\nRead more\nWritten January 17, 2021",
